The S-Bahn stops at the next station.
I must get out here.
I get out and walk to the exit.
Then I walk down the long stairs.
At the bottom, I am right by the river.
I walk along the riverbank.
Here stand many old buildings.
They are all made of red brick.
The path between the buildings is very beautiful.
I am looking for the small coffee roaster.
I look at my mobile phone.
The shop must be here in the street.
I walk a few more metres.
Up ahead I see a small shop.
That is the coffee roaster.
I am still standing outside on the street.
But I smell the roasted beans already here.
It smells like wonderful coffee.
I still have a few minutes.
I walk quickly to the door with my backpack.
